- C → E applies, so add E → {C, D, E}
- D → BE applies, so add B → {B, C, D, E}
- B → AD applies, so add A → {A, B, C, D, E}

No more FDs add attributes, so CD+ = **{A, B, C, D, E}**. It contains every attribute, so CD **is** a superkey.

